# target/

Cargo build artifacts directory containing compiled binaries, intermediate build outputs, and generated documentation. Automatically managed by Cargo; includes debug and release build targets.

## Dirs

- `debug/` -- Debug-mode build artifacts and compiled crates
- `doc/` -- Generated Rustdoc HTML documentation
- `flycheck0/` -- Intermediate artifacts from flycheck incremental compilation

## Files

- `CACHEDIR.TAG` -- Cache directory marker for cache cleanup tools
- `.rustc_info.json` -- Rustc version and configuration metadata
- `.rustdoc_fingerprint.json` -- Fingerprint for documentation generation tracking
